    :func:`torch.svd` is deprecated in favor of :func:`torch.linalg.svd`
    and will be removed in a future PyTorch release.

    ``U, S, V = torch.svd(A, some=some, compute_uv=True)`` (default) should be replaced with

    .. code:: python

